    "id": "overlap-fb",
    "language": "[0][1]Okay, so this is the same scenario where my teammate is, um, being blocked by t- the opponent in front of him. So my teammate... Oh. Uh... My... (laughs) My teammate has the ball,[2] and so I'm gonna overlap towards the left side and, uh, so he can pass the ball to me. And if the opponent is too close to me, then I'll pass it back to my teammate. Otherwise, I can make the shot towards the goal. So I'm gonna go here,[3] tell him to pass.[4] [5][6][7]So now that I received the ball, the opponent is, uh, approaching me but, um, is, he's not too close to me yet so I'm gonna make the shot towards the goal.[8]",
